      "source_id": "h2",
      "actor": "user",
      "role": "family_member",
      "fact": "Vera Sokolova (family member) provided her own details and claimed to act on behalf of Artem Sokolov (account holder)."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "h27",
      "actor": "user",
      "role": "family_member",
      "fact": "Vera Sokolova explicitly stated she is confirming the plan change for Artem Sokolov, who is currently unavailable."
    },
